The '''Magma Cube Rider''' is a hostile [[Mob]]. They are found commonly all over the {{Zone|Burning Desert}} area of the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Behavior ==
If a player is nearby, the Magma Cube Rider will begin to jump towards the player every few seconds, dealing {{Stat|damage}} on hit.

